                     <title>Collectanea H. de Knaresborough</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Formerly Studley Royal, Mr H. Vyner, the
                        second, first, third and fifth MSS. respectively are listed in the 1964 edn.
                        Fragments of a missal formerly Add. 62129 were identified as pastedowns from
                        Add. 62132A and are now Add. 62132B. The fourth Vyner MS. was stolen in 1964
                        and is at present unretraced.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Cf. Hist. MSS. Comm. Rep. 6. 357 and Chester
                        Beatty, Cat. Western MSS.</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
